{"title":"2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the following sequence of figures showing arrangements of square tiles:\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>More figures can be drawn, each having one row of tiles more than the previous figure. This new bottom row is constructed using two tiles more than the number of tiles in the bottom\nrow of the previous figure.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a (page does not exist)\">2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b (page does not exist)\">2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1c (page does not exist)\">2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1c</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1d&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1d (page does not exist)\">2010 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1d</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017223243\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 19/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 407/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.408      1 Template:Image_needed\n100.00%    5.408      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37009:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017223243 and revision id 285968. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}